This directory contains some sample output files, generated
with the TUV model.  Five different cases are given, using
different default input files:

INPUT :  OUTPUT   LOG
________________________
defin1:  usrout1  tuvlog1
defin2:  usrout2  tuvlog2
defin3:  usrout3  tuvlog3
defin4:  usrout4  tuvlog4
defin5:  sq_wrf   tuvlog5
___________________________________________________________
Last build:  9 January 2019
(very low values were zeroed out by disort because ABSCUT = 10.  Now with
ABSCUT = 1000. the new values are very small but not zero.  This affects
mainly tropospheric UV-C values which are very low.)
by S. Madronich

-----------------------------------------------------------
Early-Earth / multi-model UV comparison (this installation)
-----------------------------------------------------------
Stock samples above are from interactive NCAR defaults.
For the WACCM6 + 1D-model extension (VULCAN, Photochem, Atmos,
Kasting), see the project README:

  ../README.md

and the driver:

  ../run_TUV.py

WACCM cases map to Early_Earth.py variables Pre_h0, Ten_h0,
One_h0, Zero1_h0 (CESM_data NetCDFs), not the older *_pc_h0
files under H_escape/.
